e modeling of uncertainty. After that, we focus primarily on machine learning, starting with methods for reasoning under uncertainty. We cover learning of decision trees from examples, reinforcement learning in Markov Decision Processes, perceptron learning, and deep learning. We touch briefly on the future of AI.     The teaching methodology combines lectures, in-class and out-of-class exercises, and programming assignments.","topics":[],"score":2206},{"name":"nickubed/golf_analyzer","owner":"nickubed","html_url":"https://github.com/nickubed/golf_analyzer","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"this has way less to do with golf than you may be hoping","topics":[],"score":2206},{"name":"booshja/SetPlaylist-Python","owner":"booshja","html_url":"https://github.com/booshja/SetPlaylist-Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"My first Capstone in Springboard's Software Engineering Bootcamp. Built with Python, Flask, SASS, and a touch of JavaScript.","topics":[],"score":2206},{"name":"dwalicki/video_subscription","owner":"dwalicki","html_url":"https://github.com/dwalicki/video_subscription","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2206},{"name":"decheverri123/reddit_post_alert","owner":"decheverri123","html_url":"https://github.com/decheverri123/reddit_post_alert","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Send text message and email when a new post in a specified subreddit is created","topics":[],"score":2206},{"name":"paulsheridan/employee-growth-platform","owner":"paulsheridan","html_url":"https://github.com/paulsheridan/employee-growth-platform","stars":0,"forks":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Tracking employee growth and career progress through feedback, checkins and coaching.","topics":[],"score":2206},{"name":"Mikejmnez/calculator_bundle","owner":"Mikejmnez","html_url":"https://github.com/Mikejmnez/calculator_bundle",